Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: locality (validates ADR 0006)
Purpose:
    Confirm that 1-hop locality profiles distinguish the cycle/star
    collision flagged in the ADR 0005 experiment log. Record the
    behavior on the full six-graph suite and lock the known chain-middle
    / cycle-edge 1-hop collision.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0006 (LocalityProfile: co_left / co_right / forward / reverse
    counts; 1-hop, direction-preserving).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0006.
    Runner: v2/examples/locality.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example locality

